DESCRIPTION:🎃 Pumpkin Painting with SCWVLDI 🎃\n\nCome hang out with SCWVLDI on October 23rd from 11 AM to 1 PM at the Ramada for a fun fall afternoon! We'll be painting pumpkins\, enjoying a caramel apple dipping bar\, and spending time with fellow club members and faculty.\n\nWhether you're an artist or just looking to relax\, this is a great chance to unwind and connect with everyone.\n\nDon't forget to pay your club dues before attending! Please sign up on the Google Sheets attached!\n\nWe can't wait to see you there! 🍂🍎🎨✨\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377228
