BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:GO1tzzL7MWLNX1spGALp@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:Volunteering with Ability360
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
DESCRIPTION:Join the PM&R Club in volunteering at the Ability360 Goalball Tournament from January 15-17. Goalball is a Paralympic sport designed for athletes with visual impairments\, offering participants a unique opportunity to support adaptive athletics and promote accessibility in sports. Volunteers will assist with event operations\, help athletes and spectators\, and gain exposure to the adaptive sports community. This is a great opportunity to serve the community\, learn about rehabilitation and disability advocacy\, and represent Midwestern University while making a meaningful impact.\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377892
DTSTART:20270115T170000Z
DTEND:20270117T210000Z
END:VEVENT
