SUMMARY:Guest Speaker: Dr. Alexis Linnebur
LOCATION:Online Event
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for our amazing guest speaker: Dr. Alexis Linnebur\, a Midwestern CDMI alumna and Oral Maxillofacial Surgeon. She will speak on her experience as an Oral Maxillofacial Surgeon with a fellowship in Pediatric Cleft and Craniofacial Surgery\, her experience as a female OMFS\, and presentation on some of her surgery cases.\n\nMeeting Link: https://us05web.zoom.us/j/83041645531?pwd=UxC6RISh7ddxviaF9RtmbijkDT62qc.1\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377957
